{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/Title.png?t=1745796006\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Philosophers already waste their time and lives thinking about thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why not have fun while doing it?<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/Gift_A.gif?t=1745796006\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Trolley Solution</strong> is a compilation of minigames based on the famous trolley problem, originally proposed in 1967 by British philosopher Philippa Foot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/Gift_B.gif?t=1745796006\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put your thinking power to the test  in humorous iterations of the problem. Unlock a variety of minigames where you can put your gaming skills to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/Gift_C.gif?t=1745796006\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge yourself and learn important and useful philosophical knowledge while expanding your mind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 20 trolley problem variations (plus the original)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 20 minigames inspired by each variation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Disclaimer: You might not actually learn anything useful or important, nor expand your mind, by playing this game.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3219410?t=1745796006","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/5